  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-08-29T23:42:16.573Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The `Offline for` time reported in the client appears to be based on the user's last reported login time, rather than the user's last reported activity time, which typically corresponds to the last reported interaction with any part of the VRChat client. In some of the images provided below, the user was last online `3 hours ago`, but the client reports the time as `8 hours ago`, reflecting their last reported login time.\n\nThere are some inconsistencies here, and additional API endpoints may be needed to accurately report when a user was last online, rather than relying on `Last Login` or `Last Activity`.",
